<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Garden Ridge cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Garden Ridge cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns downgraded Garden Ridge Corp to neutral from attractive, market sources said.</p>
<p>-- Garden Ridge lost 1 to 6-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
